Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you rent your card\Nmachine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,there's a rule you should\Nknow about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Since January 2023,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:08.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,the payments regulator\Nsays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:11.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,a terminal lease can only\Ntie you in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,for 18 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:15.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not three years, not four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:17.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,When those 18 months are\Nup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,the big providers have to\Nwrite and tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:21.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The letter gives the date
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,your minimum term ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,and that you're free to\Nswitch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:26.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,to another card machine\Nprovider.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:29.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you choose to stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,you can still leave at any\Ntime after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,as long as you give them\None month's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some deals are fine as\Nthey are,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:38.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,but you won't know until\Nyou compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comparing terminal rates\Nis easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,it doesn't take long,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the difference between\Nproviders
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,adds up over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here at NeroPay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,you can get a quote in\Nminutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:52.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Drop us a message or give\Nus a call
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:54.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,and speak to someone from\Nour team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's it for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:57.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,give us a follow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:59.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,to keep up with more\Nvideos like this.
